        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "岸上家庭听见盖索的名字，想到出航名单与迟迟不归的船影。对他们而言，荣耀不是最大鲸骨，而是冬天有人记得敲响寡妇的门。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": null,
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
